# file-upload-audit Rule

When auditing with this skill:
1. Follow the checklists in `.agents/skills/file-upload-audit/references/`: `upload_checks.md` (UP-*) and `upload_vuln_checklist.md` (FU-001 to FU-020). Generate harmless test files with `scripts/upload_testfiles.py`.
2. Master skill: `.agents/skills/file-upload-audit/SKILL.md`.
3. Run `scripts/scope_check.sh TARGET` first. Use `scripts/route_target.py` to pick rows from recon artifacts.
